<title>POLAND: Polish builder Atlantis IPO oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Polish builder Atlantis IPO oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    Atlantis SA construction</p>
<p>						and trading firm</p>
<p> Type of Issue:			   new common shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:	  5 million</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Subscribed:     20.6 million</p>
<p> Price (PLN)				6</p>
<p>TRANCHES	 NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES     ORDERS</p>
<p>		   SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTED	    REDUCTION (PCT)</p>
<p>Institutional  11,843,940     3,500,000	  66.44</p>
<p>Retail	    8,749,260     1,500,000	  82.86</p>
<p>The firm said 32 investors taking part in book-building received shares in the institutional tranche.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
